<SCENARIO VER="105">
<TXSPN>Now, I will guide you to the next route. The route we follow next strongly depicts the inner heart of a certain person. It would be good to watch it with your focus on that person.<PG>
Ah, and one more thing. Let me tell you in advance that in the next route, the three of them, Natsumi Kogori, Haruka Niimura and Erina Goto, survive to the end.<PG>
But whether that is a good thing or a bad thing―for the rest, please see for yourself.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\イラスト\立木三日2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "立木三日,立木ボード,プレート" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="NOREPAGE">
